## Title: Good to Go
## Notes: Auto-updating macros for your best food, water, potions, and healthstones, a Restock List that auto-buys and banks reagents and ammo, click-to-cast missing buffs, auto thank-you whispers, and mouseover macros for every spell.
## Author: Gogo1951

## IconTexture: Interface/AddOns/Good-to-Go/Includes/Images/Connoisseur.tga
